@startuml online-retention-contract
' Fixed-query unknown-target-stream retention and reclamation contract.
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #455A64
  FontColor #102027
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

title Unknown-length target stream — prefix-independent retained memory

queue "target labels\nunknown total length" as Stream #B2EBF2

package "Retained for the machine lifetime" #E3F2FD {
  component "validated fixed query\nand query plan" as Query #BBDEFB
  component "bounded transition cache\nor finite ring metadata" as Cache #D1C4E9
}

package "Two-generation transition" #E8F5E9 {
  component "current frontier / row" as Current #C8E6C9
  component "scratch next frontier / row" as Next #DCEDC8
}

component "observation\nexact prefix result or tagged incomplete" as Observation #FFE0B2
collections "discarded target prefix" as Discarded #ECEFF1

Stream -[#1565C0,thickness=3]-> Next : one label
Query -[#1565C0]-> Next : fixed recurrence data
Current -[#1565C0]-> Next : live predecessors only
Cache -[#5E35B1]-> Next : observed transition reuse
Next -[#2E7D32,thickness=3]-> Observation : validate before commit
Next -[#2E7D32,thickness=3]-> Current : swap generations
Current -[#78909C]-> Discarded : old generation reclaimed

note bottom of Current #FFF3E0
  <latex>M = O(|q| + |F| + |C|)</latex>
  depends on the fixed query, live frontier, and configured cache;
  it does not depend on the number of target labels already consumed.
end note

note right of Observation #FFECB3
  A budget, arithmetic, validation, or allocation failure is explicit.
  It is never converted into a complete empty answer.
end note

note bottom of Discarded #FFCDD2
  No exact fixed-query online automaton stores the consumed target history.
  Exact distance between two mutually unbounded histories is not this contract.
end note
@enduml
